WEBVTT

00:00:58.679 --> 00:01:01.182
But his words didn't make any sense to me,

00:01:01.182 --> 00:01:03.267
because if the Klan hated Black folks,

00:01:03.267 --> 00:01:05.645
I was all right with hating them back.

00:01:05.686 --> 00:01:07.105
Sounded OK to me.

00:01:08.606 --> 00:01:10.441
But then something happened.

00:01:10.942 --> 00:01:16.823
It became my job to help people
who were leaving hate groups,

00:01:16.823 --> 00:01:19.283
and then once I got to know them,

00:01:19.325 --> 00:01:21.035
I couldn't hate them anymore.

00:01:21.869 --> 00:01:23.913
And then I got confused.

00:01:24.872 --> 00:01:29.919
I'm a survivor of racial violence,
rape and incest,